00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:53.286
- So, it's easy to have ideas.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:57.390
It's very hard to turn an idea
into a successful product.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.019
There are a lot of steps in between it.

00:00:59.019 --> 00:01:02.330
It takes persistence, relentlessness.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.811
So, I always tell people,

00:01:03.811 --> 00:01:07.623
who think they want to be entrepreneurs.

00:01:07.623 --> 00:01:09.956
You need a combination of...

00:01:11.435 --> 00:01:14.852
Stubborn relentlessness, and flexibility.

00:01:16.245 --> 00:01:18.334
