00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:21.574
And basically, you need to
be stubborn on your vision.

00:01:21.574 --> 00:01:24.383
And because, otherwise, it'll
be too easy, to give up.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:27.805
But, you need to be very
flexible on the details,

00:01:27.805 --> 00:01:30.194
