Julio, thank you so much, for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:53.554
Your One Word,

00:19:53.554 --> 00:19:56.015
and posting that review
on your YouTube channel.

00:19:56.015 --> 00:19:57.864
I really, really
appreciate the support man,

00:19:57.864 --> 00:20:00.064
and I'm so glad that you enjoyed the book.

