- Today's book is called, Your
One Word, by Evan Carmichael.

00:20:03.335 --> 00:20:04.723
- So, thank you guys again, for watching.

00:20:04.723 --> 00:20:06.055
I believe in you.

00:20:06.055 --> 00:20:08.145
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:20:08.145 --> 00:20:11.953
